    "Fully Local's certificate is no longer accepted by iOS, so installs now use Offline. You can change this in Settings → Installation → Server & SSL." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El certificado de Fully Local ya no es aceptado por iOS, por lo que las instalaciones ahora usan Offline. Puedes cambiar esto en Ajustes → Instalación → Servidor y SSL."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le certificat de Fully Local n'est plus accepté par iOS, les installations utilisent donc Offline. Vous pouvez changer cela dans Paramètres → Installation → Serveur et SSL."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il certificato di Fully Local non è più accettato da iOS, quindi le installazioni ora usano Offline. Puoi modificare questo in Impostazioni → Installazione → Server & SSL."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fully Local's certificate is no longer accepted by iOS, so installs now use Semi Local. For installs without the internet, set up Offline in Settings → Installation → Server & SSL." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El certificado de Fully Local ya no es aceptado por iOS, por lo que las instalaciones ahora usan Semi Local. Para instalaciones sin internet, configura Offline en Ajustes → Instalación → Servidor y SSL."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le certificat de Fully Local n'est plus accepté par iOS, les installations utilisent donc Semi Local. Pour les installations sans internet, configurez Offline dans Paramètres → Installation → Serveur et SSL."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il certificato di Fully Local non è più accettato da iOS, quindi le installazioni ora usano Semi Local. Per installazioni senza internet, configura Offline in Impostazioni → Installazione → Server & SSL."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fully Local's certificate was withdrawn by its issuer, so iOS refuses it. Use Semi Local, or set up Offline installs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El certificado de Fully Local fue revocado por su emisor, así que iOS lo rechaza. Usa Semi Local, o configura instalaciones sin conexión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le certificat de Fully Local a été révoqué par son émetteur, iOS le refuse donc. Utilisez Semi Local ou configurez les installations Offline."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il certificato di Fully Local è stato revocato dall'emittente, quindi iOS lo rifiuta. Usa Semi Local oppure configura le installazioni offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
